    "chunk_text": "Benedicta & beata sis semper is aeternum & in thronum Dei, Connumerata & computata sis cum choris \u00d0a heo hyre gebed geendod h\u00e6fde, heo upastod & to hyre modor cneowum onbeah. & heo hy \u00f0a mid sibbecosse gegrette & ealle da geferr\u00e6dene samod & hy hire w\u00e6ter to handa b\u00e6ron Him \u00f0a eallum \u00e6tg\u00e6derum sittendum ongan seo abbodyssa, hyre modor, of \u00f0am Dauiticum sealmum Swaswa Anna seo halige wuduwa & Simeon se ealda sungon & drymdon, \u00f0a hy \u00fe\u00e6t mycele & \u00fe\u00e6t Heo sang \u00fea o\u00f0er fers, Confirma hoc, Deus, quod operatus es in nobis a templo sancto tuo, quod est in Heo sang \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0ridde,Saluos nos fac, Domine Deus noster, & congrega nos de nationibus, ut \u00d0ylicum & fela o\u00f0rum godcundlicum wordum heo hyre leofe bearn georne l\u00e6rde & to Gode tihte. W\u00e6s hit hyre eac eadd\u00e6de, swa lange swa hyre ingehyd w\u00e6s eal mid Godes gaste afylled. N\u00e6s heo, swa nu \u00e6\u00f0elborene men synt, mid ofermettum afylled ne mid woruldprydum ne mid ny\u00f0um N\u00e6s heo sacful ne geflitgeorn. N\u00e6s heo swicol nanum \u00fe\u00e6ra\u00fee hyre to dohte. Heo w\u00e6s wuduwena & steopcilda arigend & ealra earmra & geswincendra frefriend & on eallum W\u00e6s heo swy\u00f0e gemyndi, \u00fe\u00e6t we ealle of twam mannum comon & of eor\u00f0an lame gescepene & Gemunde..",
